{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "HappyHorse 视频生成",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "提交 HappyHorse 视频生成任务。请求地址与统一视频接口相同：`POST /v1/video/generations`。\n\n立即返回任务 ID，可通过 `GET /v1/video/generations/{task_id}` 查询。\n\n**调用约定：**\n- 图生、参考图、视频编辑的素材只通过 `metadata.content` 传入。\n- 首帧必须写 `role=first_frame`。参考图写 `reference_image`；不写 `role` 时按参考图处理。\n- 待编辑视频写 `type=video_url`，`role=reference_video`。\n- 宽高比写 `ratio`，只用于文生和参考图。图生跟随首帧，视频编辑跟随输入视频。\n- 视频编辑不传 `duration`，时长跟随输入视频。`audio_setting=mute` 表示静音输出。\n"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "视频（Videos）/HappyHorse 系列"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "使用 Bearer Token 认证。\n格式: `Authorization: Bearer sk-xxxxxx`\n"
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/video/generations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "视频（Videos）/HappyHorse 系列"
        ],
        "summary": "HappyHorse 视频生成",
        "description": "提交 HappyHorse 视频生成任务（文生、首帧、参考图、视频编辑）。",
        "operationId": "createHappyHorseVideoGeneration",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "model"
                ],
                "description": "视频生成请求",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "模型 ID。\n\n| model | 说明 |\n|---|---|\n| `happyhorse-1.0-t2v` | 文生视频。`prompt` 必填，可用 `ratio` |\n| `happyhorse-1.0-i2v` | 首帧图生。`content` 必填，`role=first_frame`。不传宽高比 |\n| `happyhorse-1.0-r2v` | 参考图生成。`content` 必填，`role=reference_image`。可用 `ratio` |\n| `happyhorse-1.0-video-edit` | 视频编辑。待编辑视频为 `type=video_url`。不传宽高比和时长 |\n",
                    "examples": [
                      "happyhorse-1.0-t2v",
                      "happyhorse-1.0-i2v",
                      "happyhorse-1.0-r2v",
                      "happyhorse-1.0-video-edit"
                    ]
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "文本描述提示词。t2v 模式必填；i2v / 参考图模式建议填写以精确描述运动效果。",
                    "examples": [
                      "宇航员站起身走了",
                      "小猫慢慢睁开眼睛，轻轻伸了个懒腰"
                    ]
                  },
                  "duration": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "视频时长（秒）。文生、首帧、参考图接受 `5` 或 `10`。视频编辑不传，时长跟随输入视频。",
                    "examples": [
                      5,
                      8,
                      10
                    ]
                  },
                  "resolution": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "分辨率。`720p`、`1080p`。",
                    "examples": [
                      "1080p",
                      "720p"
                    ]
                  },
                  "ratio": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "宽高比，如 `16:9`、`9:16`、`1:1`。只用于文生和参考图。图生跟随首帧，视频编辑跟随输入视频。",
                    "examples": [
                      "16:9",
                      "9:16",
                      "1:1"
                    ]
                  },
                  "seed": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "随机种子，控制生成结果可复现性。全部模型支持。",
                    "examples": [
                      20231234
                    ]
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "扩展参数。\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `content` | array | 素材列表。图生、参考图、视频编辑必填。见下方元素字段 |\n| `audio_setting` | string | 仅视频编辑。`mute` 表示静音输出 |\n\n### `content` 元素结构\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `type` | string | `image_url` / `video_url` |\n| `role` | string | 见下表 |\n| `image_url.url` | string | 图片地址 |\n| `video_url.url` | string | 视频地址。视频编辑时为待编辑视频 |\n\n**`role` 取值：**\n\n| role | 适用 type | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `first_frame` | image_url | 首帧。必须显式填写，省略时按参考图提交 |\n| `reference_image` | image_url | 参考图 |\n| `reference_video` | video_url | 待编辑视频 |\n",
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "properties": {
                      "audio_setting": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "仅 `happyhorse-1.0-video-edit`。`mute` 表示静音输出。",
                        "examples": [
                          "mute"
                        ]
                      },
                      "content": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "素材列表。首帧写 `first_frame`，参考图写 `reference_image`，待编辑视频写 `type=video_url` 且 `role=reference_video`。",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "enum": [
                                "image_url",
                                "video_url",
                                "audio_url"
                              ],
                              "description": "`image_url` / `video_url` / `audio_url`"
                            },
                            "image_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "图片地址。"
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            "video_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "视频地址。"
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            "audio_url": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "url": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "音频地址。"
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            "role": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "enum": [
                                "first_frame",
                                "last_frame",
                                "reference_image",
                                "reference_video",
                                "reference_audio"
                              ],
                              "description": "不写时图片按参考图处理。首帧必须写 `first_frame`。"
                            },
                            "reference_type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "HappyHorse 不使用。"
                            },
                            "name": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "HappyHorse 不使用。"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "x-apifox-orders": [
                      "content",
                      "audio_setting"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "x-apifox-orders": [
                  "model",
                  "prompt",
                  "duration",
                  "resolution",
                  "ratio",
                  "seed",
                  "metadata"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "happyhorse-1-0-t2v": {
                  "summary": "HappyHorse 1.0 文生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-t2v",
                    "prompt": "一座由硬纸板和瓶盖搭建的微型城市，在夜晚焕发出生机，小灯点缀其间，照亮前路",
                    "resolution": "1080p",
                    "ratio": "16:9",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "seed": 20240101
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-i2v": {
                  "summary": "HappyHorse 1.0 图生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-i2v",
                    "prompt": "小猫慢慢睁开眼睛，环顾四周，轻轻伸了个懒腰",
                    "metadata": {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "role": "first_frame",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://example.com/cat.jpg"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-r2v": {
                  "summary": "HappyHorse 1.0 参考图生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-r2v",
                    "prompt": "保持角色风格，让她在花海中奔跑，裙摆飘动",
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "ratio": "9:16",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "seed": 20240202,
                    "metadata": {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "role": "reference_image",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://example.com/character-ref1.jpg"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "role": "reference_image",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://example.com/character-ref2.jpg"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "happyhorse-1-0-video-edit": {
                  "summary": "HappyHorse 1.0 视频编辑",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "happyhorse-1.0-video-edit",
                    "prompt": "将视频中的白天场景替换为夜晚霓虹灯风格，保留人物动作不变",
                    "metadata": {
                      "audio_setting": "mute",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "video_url",
                          "role": "reference_video",
                          "video_url": {
                            "url": "https://example.com/source-video.mp4"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "image_url",
                          "role": "reference_image",
                          "image_url": {
                            "url": "https://example.com/style-ref.jpg"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功创建视频生成任务",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "description": "视频生成任务提交响应",
                  "properties": {
                    "task_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "任务 ID，用于后续通过 GET /v1/video/generations/:task_id 查询状态",
                      "examples": [
                        "task_aehCmxJ5YUNOIQGgkhvxaco4T9P2h3Dw"
                      ]
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "queued",
                        "NOT_START"
                      ],
                      "description": "任务初始状态。不同渠道表现不同：\n- `queued` — 已进入本地队列，后台处理\n- `NOT_START` — 已提交至上游，等待系统轮询\n\n请使用 `GET /v1/video/generations/{task_id}` 轮询最终状态。",
                      "examples": [
                        "queued"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "x-apifox-orders": [
                    "task_id",
                    "status"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "错误信息"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "错误类型"
                        },
                        "param": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "description": "相关参数"
                        },
                        "code": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "description": "错误代码"
                        }
                      },
                      "x-apifox-orders": [
                        "message",
                        "type",
                        "param",
                        "code"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "x-apifox-orders": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
